WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Iyi videwo itanga intangiriro kubikoresho bya Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Hindura ukoresheje iyi buto yumukara.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Ubwa mbere, impande zombi za Arclight zishobora kuza icyarimwe.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Niba itaje na gato cyangwa amatara yijimye, bateri irashobora kuba iringaniye.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Shyira mugukoresha USB charger.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Iyo kwishyuza, amatara yicyatsi azaza.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Nyuma yiminota 15, igomba kwishyurwa byuzuye kandi igakora amasaha menshi.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Kubireka ku zuba bizakomeza bateri.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Ntuzakenera gusimbuza bateri cyangwa amatara.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Uburyo iyo impande zombi ziza ni izikoreshwa muri rusange.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Hindura muburyo bwamaso ufashe buto kumasegonda 15.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Noneho uzamure intoki zawe hanyuma wongere ukande vuba nkuko urumuri rwaka.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Ubu uri muburyo bwamaso, aho ophthalmoscope izaza

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
ubanza, hanyuma igice cyimbere loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Gusubiramo izi ntambwe bizunguruka muburyo butatu bwo gukoresha.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Gukoresha muri rusange, amaso, hanyuma ugutwi.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Umaze guhitamo uburyo bwatoranijwe, kanda buto yumukara

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
ihindura uburyo amatara yaka kandi iherezo ryaka.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Menya neza ko ukoresha iherezo ryukuri kugirango usuzume neza.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Ijisho ryo hanze risuzumwa ukoresheje loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Reba izaba isobanutse mugihe wegereye cyane ijisho kuri cm 6.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
Inkunga ya fondasiyo ikorwa muburebure bwamaboko ukoresheje ophthalmoscope.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Niba ibiboneka bidasobanutse, noneho reba lens rack iri hejuru.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
Muriyi myanya, nta lens iri mu mwobo wo kureba kandi reflex igomba kuba isobanutse.

25
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.180
Arclight irashobora kandi gukoreshwa mugufata amashusho yibimenyetso byubuvuzi

26
00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:53.760
iyo yometse kuri kamera ya terefone igendanwa.

27
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.810
Bimaze gufatanwa, umwobo wo kureba wa ophthalmoscope

28
00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:05.920
bizashyirwa hejuru ya lens kamera yawe igendanwa ikoresha muburyo bwa videwo.

29
00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.800
Kamera izakora nkamaso yawe mugihe urimo kureba mu mwobo wo kureba.

30
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.720
Kwemeza lens gutondekanya umwobo wo kureba hamwe,

31
00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.760
fungura porogaramu ya videwo kuri terefone yawe, shyira urutoki kuri buri lens.

32
00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:27.100
Iyo ecran yijimye, uba utwikiriye lens ikoreshwa kuri videwo.

33
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.960
Kuraho impapuro z'umuhondo inyuma ya clip.

34
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.180
Shira ingingo z'umwambi hejuru ya lens zikoreshwa mu gufata amashusho.

35
00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.040
Kanda clip hasi ushikamye.

36
00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.150
Kuraho umwambi.

37
00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:47.410
Clip igomba kuba mumwanya ukwiye.

38
00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:51.470
Kugirango ushireho amashusho, hindura kuri ophthalmoscope

39
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.770
iherezo rya Arclight hanyuma uhitemo urumuri rwinshi ukanze gatatu.

40
00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.310
Menya neza ko lens rack iri hejuru.

41
00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.820
Numucyo ureba kure ya terefone werekeza umurwayi,

42
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.840
shyira Arclight muri clip hanyuma ukuremo elastike hejuru kugirango umutekano.

43
00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.840
Shyira Arclight hejuru kugeza idashobora kunyerera ukundi.

44
00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.380
Umwobo wo kureba wa ophthalmoscope itaziguye

45
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.560
ubu bizaba byuzuye hejuru ya lens ifata amashusho.

46
00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.460
Kwandika ijisho ryo hanze, koresha urundi ruhande rwibikoresho.

47
00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:34.160
Gufata amashusho, fungura porogaramu ya videwo hanyuma uhindure,

48
00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.020
kuzuza ecran hamwe no kureba unyuze mu mwobo.

49
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.000
Kanda inyandiko hanyuma ukore ikizamini.

50
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.220
Kanda ahagarike hanyuma ubike videwo.

51
00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.200
Urashobora noneho gusangira nabagenzi bawe kumurongo wizewe, uhishe

52
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:53.260
gusa kubwintego wabonye uruhushya rwumurwayi.

53
00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.890
Ishimire gukoresha Arclight mubikorwa byawe.
